WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Jamie advances under the Level 3 fall.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.500
The first Rush crouching heavy catches Ryu.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.100
OD Palm extends the corner juggle.

4
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.500
Jamie starts another raw Rush below the falling Ryu.

5
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.050
The second raw-Rush crouching heavy catches Ryu before the last OD spend.

6
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.900
The second OD Palm continues the juggle in the recorded burnout route.

7
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.850
Heavy Arrow finishes the final launcher.

8
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.650
The later heavy-Arrow hit continues the corner juggle.

9
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.900
Ryu lands while Jamie remains in burnout.
